Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.74,0:00:02.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You have 5 years before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:03.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superintelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A machine smarter than any human,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:07.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at almost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.89,0:00:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That means the biggest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}change in human history,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in the shortest time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The plow changed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the work of our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.41,0:00:16.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The engine, our muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The computer, our memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But thinking still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:20.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}needed a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:21.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And those changes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:23.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}took generations:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:25.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the children learned the new work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This time, there is no next
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}generation to wait for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:29.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It falls to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:30.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So how do you get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ready in 5 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:35.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The change has already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Some insiders expect the first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:38.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superhuman AI as early
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:39.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}as next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:42.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But you have something almost no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}generation got before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:45.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its world changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.47,0:00:47.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The people building
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:48.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:50.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}named the deadline themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:51.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the first thing to get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:53.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ready is not your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:00:56.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Picture a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:57.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A stranger at your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:59.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}table asks what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You have the answer ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You have given it for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.97,0:01:03.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now picture giving
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.95,0:01:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a different one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:06.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The historian Yuval Noah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:10.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari says you will have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:11.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He is no engineer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and warnings like his sell books.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:15.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But hear him out:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:25.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:27.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He calls it the end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.40,0:01:29.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of lifetime careers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:30.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And he expects the change
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:32.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to go on for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So start the countdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.21,0:01:35.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One step for each year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:37.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the hardest question
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:38.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}waits at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.07,0:01:41.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}5 years to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:43.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first step is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:44.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It comes first because
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:45.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it takes the longest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.98,0:01:47.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it pays off even
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:48.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if the builders are wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:49.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:50.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}arrives much later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:52.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Reinvent yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:54.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It sounds like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:56.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a young person's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:57.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The data disagrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:01:58.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Among America's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fastest-growing new companies,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the average founder
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:03.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was 45 at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.22,0:02:04.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:05.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But it matters who
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:07.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}chooses the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People who switch jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:10.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}late in their careers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by their own choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:13.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}tend to end up more satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:14.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People laid off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:16.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in their late 40s lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on average, more
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than a quarter of their pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.05,0:02:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is a comparison, not proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:23.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the same change
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.69,0:02:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is a different thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:26.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}chosen or forced.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:28.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What the next generation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:30.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}always had was a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:32.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So choose your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.15,0:02:33.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}while nothing depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:35.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Become a beginner
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:36.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at one thing this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.93,0:02:38.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and stay with the awkward part.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:41.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At work, take on one new
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}role before anyone asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Join one group that has
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}never heard your job title.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If the title goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:49.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you are still somebody there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Resilience is partly practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So when the big change comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.35,0:02:55.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it will not be your first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.21,0:02:57.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But starting over
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:58.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is only half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.15,0:03:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If a machine can do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:01.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your task in a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:02.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what is your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}experience still worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.19,0:03:06.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}4 years to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This step is your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:09.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And here, there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is evidence on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:13.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One AI company studied how
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}people work with its own tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:16.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Experts succeeded more
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:19.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than twice as often as beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With the same tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:22.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In that study,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.85,0:03:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the machine did not
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:25.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}level the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It rewarded the people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who already knew the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Does that make you safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:31.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The study watched one coding tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:35.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not every trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And when people in their
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:38.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}late 50s and early 60s
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are out of work,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:41.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it lasts 34 weeks on average.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So experience is an edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:45.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not a guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:47.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And an edge only
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:48.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}counts if you use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:50.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Learn the machine on the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.61,0:03:52.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}while you still have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:03:53.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is your guard against
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:55.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}those weeks outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:56.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But you can only do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.69,0:03:58.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so much on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.60,0:03:59.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:01.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than 200 economists
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:02.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and AI researchers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:04.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}signed one statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:05.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not to pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:06.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}To prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One of its organizers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Stanford's Erik Brynjolfsson,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:11.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}makes the case:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:24.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:25.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:26.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:27.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:35.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You met this machine as an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:36.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But what about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.27,0:04:37.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the next generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the people growing up with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:40.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}3 years to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This step is your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:43.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your children.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.96,0:04:45.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:47.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}3 in 4 teenagers use
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:48.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI in their free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.93,0:04:50.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most have tried an AI companion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:52.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a chatbot you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:53.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to like a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:55.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}California now has a law for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:56.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A companion chatbot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:57.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}must tell a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at least every 3 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:01.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that it is not a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:03.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Somebody had to write
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:05.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that sentence into law.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:07.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari has a name for a generation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:09.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}growing up with machine friends:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:11.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a psychological experiment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on a global scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:26.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This time, the next generation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:28.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can't do the adapting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:29.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The reflex is to forbid
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:32.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the machine friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:33.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But a ban may only
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:35.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}hide them from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:37.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So ask instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:39.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Which AI do you talk to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:40.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.59,0:05:42.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is there one you'd call a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:43.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then ask to read
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one chat together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:46.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That protects against
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:47.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with a machine you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:49.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}know nothing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:50.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But if a machine can
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.86,0:05:52.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}already act like a friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:54.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}how close is the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:56.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Are the 5 years even real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.78,0:05:59.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}2 years to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:01.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This step is the machine itself:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what you actually know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:04.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}5 years to full
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:07.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superintelligence is not a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:08.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A short deadline helps
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.63,0:06:09.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a lab raise money,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:10.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and many outside
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}experts say much later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:13.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:14.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the experts have repeatedly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}underestimated how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:17.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fast this moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The chatbot most people know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:20.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is not yet old enough for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By its maker's count,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the accounts using
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it every week have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:25.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}passed a billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:27.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And even most of their later dates
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:29.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are less than a generation away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:30.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So it is the deadline
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:32.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}worth preparing for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:33.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If it takes longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:34.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you were early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:37.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If it takes five, you were ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is what the experts know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:40.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.66,0:06:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Among Americans over 65,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.99,0:06:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more people expect AI
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:46.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to harm society than have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:48.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ever tried a chatbot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:50.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The fear arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:52.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before the experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:54.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So get the experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:56.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Give the machine one afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:56.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and a task you have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:58.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}done for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There, you see at once
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.11,0:07:01.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where it shines,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and where it is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That protects you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.47,0:07:04.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from both stories:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:06.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the sales pitch, and the shrug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:08.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It turns a vague
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:09.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fear into a judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The last step needs that judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.69,0:07:13.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because the rules for these
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machines are being
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:16.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}written right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.07,0:07:17.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not a generation from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:18.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the biggest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.53,0:07:20.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one is still blank:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who gets what the machines earn?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:25.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}1 year to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.38,0:07:27.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This step is your say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Voters have already
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:29.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}started to use theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:31.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This November, limits on new data
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}centers were on local ballots.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They won all but one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:37.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Those votes were about buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}On the bigger question,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.91,0:07:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one answer comes from both
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:41.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ends of American politics:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:43.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}give the public a stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:45.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Senator Bernie Sanders
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:46.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has put it into a bill:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:48.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a public fund of AI shares
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that pays out to every American.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.64,0:07:52.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The bill's chances are slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:53.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But here is his argument:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.83,0:08:04.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Donald Trump has floated
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the idea too: "the American
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:07.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}public essentially becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a partner with the companies."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Neither version is law.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:12.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So when this reaches
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:14.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your ballot, show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:15.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And ask everyone who wants
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:17.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your vote one question:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:19.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who gets a share of the gain?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:21.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Otherwise, others divide
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:22.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And there may be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a great deal to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:27.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Inside one AI company,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}9 in 10 of the staff
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}expect AI to be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:32.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}capable of a Nobel-level discovery
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.71,0:08:34.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before this decade is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:36.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They have a stake in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.31,0:08:38.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But if even part of it comes true,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}these years bring discoveries,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.19,0:08:41.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not only risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:43.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So suppose all of it works:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:45.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the discoveries, the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:46.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the shared gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:49.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That leaves the hardest question,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the one no ballot can settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}5 years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:53.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at another wedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a stranger asks what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who do you want to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:08:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}when nobody needs you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for your thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:02.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It can sound like a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But listen again:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it is the question
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we ask children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What do you want to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.69,0:09:09.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For most of history,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a change this big
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:11.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was left to the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This one is yours: the warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the work, and the wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There is no next
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}generation to wait for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.45,0:09:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This time, the next
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:23.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}generation is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.57,0:09:25.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:28.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.99,0:09:31.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For this generation, and the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.39,0:09:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.47,0:09:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
